#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:7
#: 5c1e2fb306884b3195711450f3b3bfcd
msgid "Brushless PWM Gimbal"
msgstr "无刷PWM云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:9
#: 9f573a59bc614576b80321dfae0870fe
msgid ""
"Many camera gimbals can accept PWM input or SBUS input for controlling the "
"roll, pitch and yaw angles.  This page describes the setup procedure to "
"allow ArduPilot to control these gimbals."
msgstr "许多相机云台可接受PWM输入或SBUS输入来控制横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。本页介绍允许ArduPilot控制这些云台的设置流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:16
#: 40096849ff4e4e7dafb062c7491d3a48
msgid ""
"These instructions are for ArduPilot 4.3 (and higher).  For ArduPilot 4.2 "
"(and lower) please refer to the :ref:`Servo Gimbal <common-camera-gimbal>` "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"本说明适用于ArduPilot 4.3（及更高版本）。ArduPilot 4.2（及更低版本）请参阅 :ref:`舵机云台 <common-"
"camera-gimbal>` 说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:19
#: 1fda24af592d4890afeca3feb09550f2
msgid "Supported Gimbals"
msgstr "支持的云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:21
#: 1071b82640d6480d9433e5813a163f36
msgid ""
"Gimbals that accept PWM input or SBUS input to control the gimbal's *lean "
"angle* should work."
msgstr "接受PWM输入或SBUS输入来控制云台*倾斜角度*的云台均应兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:23
#: a2be7a2d3ef14165a7bbda90d4f225dd
msgid ""
"Some gimbals accept PWM or SBUS input but only provide *rate* control.  "
"These gimbals will not work by default but it may be possible, using the "
"gimbal's configuration application, to configure them to interpret the input"
" for angle control."
msgstr "部分云台接受PWM或SBUS输入，但仅提供*速率*控制。这些云台默认情况下不兼容，但可能通过云台配置应用将其配置为角度控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:25
#: b872c1ae386e4613bb2f305124b4a1e7
msgid ""
"The list of supported gimbals is a work-in-progress.  If you would like to "
"add a gimbal that is known to work, please `raise an issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__"
msgstr ""
"支持的云台列表持续更新中。若您希望添加已知可用的云台，请 `提交issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:28
#: b1d322c7982447c98796a57dbd6d0481
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:34
#: 565186cf93ab4c0fadfbda122555d0cb
msgid ""
"If the gimbal has multiple PWM input ports (one for each axis), connect them"
" to the autopilot PWM output channels. If the gimbal accepts SBUS input then"
" connect it to the autopilot's SBUSo (aka \"SBus output\") port."
msgstr ""
"若云台有多个PWM输入接口（每个轴一个），将其连接至飞控的PWM输出通道。若云台接受SBUS输入，则将其连接至飞控的SBUSo（即「SBUS输出」）接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:37
#: d049e53fa7fc493b8437a84d98038141
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters.  These settings assume the autopilot's PWM outputs 9, 10 and 11 "
"will control the gimbal's roll, pitch and yaw angles respectively.  They "
"also assume common angular ranges of the gimbal which may need adjusting to "
"match the actual gimbal being used."
msgstr ""
"通过地面站连接飞控并设置以下参数。这些设置假设飞控的PWM输出9、10和11分别控制云台的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度，同时假设了云台的常用角度范围，可能需要根据实际使用的云台进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:39
#: e49d663523b74cf38ccd8e4146f876e1
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` to 7 (BrushlessPWM) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` 设置为7（BrushlessPWM），然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:40
#: f7ec451618474bfbbbbe952d3c4975c1
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` to -90 (meaning the gimbal can pitch "
"straight downwards)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` 设为 -90（表示云台可俯仰至正下方）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:41
#: c52e1d1cc22b41cc94f2ed567016fe67
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` to 25 (meaning the gimbal can pitch "
"up by 25 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` 设为 25（表示云台可向上俯仰 25 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:42
#: 4984b832e890405299af6263f23df8d7
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` to -30 (meaning the gimbal can roll "
"right 30 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` 设为 -30（表示云台可向右横滚 30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:43
#: 0b070d40229d446dbe4dea354e0a4d7f
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` to 30 (meaning the gimbal can roll left"
" 30 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` 设为 30（表示云台可向左横滚 30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:44
#: 05971ad730ba405aa146f6742e6aa309
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` to -180 (meaning the gimbal can yaw to "
"the left 180deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` 设为 -180（表示云台可向左偏航 180 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:45
#: 15dba449a1a44e1caa84bd437db70fa0
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` to 180 (meaning the gimbal can yaw to the"
" right 180deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` 设为 180（表示云台可向右偏航 180 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:46
#: 87b1adb58e1e4a75ac68c4bf7e64893f
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to 90 (deg/s) to control speed of gimbal "
"when using RC targetting"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` 设为 90（度/秒），用于控制使用 RC 瞄准时云台的转动速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:47
#: 5b77e80649a645f084ac50dd6e1cf5c3
msgid ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` to 8 (Mount1 Roll)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设为 8（Mount1 Roll）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:48
#: 7932f39fbe0245c2ada6196654ea2ae4
msgid ":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` to 7 (Mount1 Pitch)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` 设为 7（Mount1 Pitch）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:49
#: f1400b7404fb4d2fbdce741046190e56
msgid ":ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION <SERVO11_FUNCTION>` to 6 (Mount1 Yaw)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION <SERVO11_FUNCTION>` 设为 6（Mount1 Yaw）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:50
#: 36d761798dbe4f42829a929cba344dd1
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount Pitch\") to control the "
"gimbal's pitch rate with RC channel 6"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213（「Mount Pitch」），通过 RC 通道 6 控制云台俯仰速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:51
#: 4118a7cc8382472d8336467e6e47d4e1
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount Yaw\") to control the gimbal's"
" yaw rate with RC channel 7"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214（「Mount Yaw」），通过 RC 通道 7 控制云台偏航速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:52
#: 24ebf672032449aa844cf1337f8b55b6
msgid ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163 (\"Mount Lock\") to switch between "
"\"lock\" and \"follow\" mode with RC channel 8"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163（\"Mount Lock\"），用 RC 通道 8 "
"在\"锁定\"与\"跟随\"模式间切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:54
#: 626b462689634768b59c83fab491ae19
msgid ""
"See the \"Control with an RC transmitter\" section of :ref:`this page "
"<common-mount-targeting>` for more details on parameter changes required to "
"control the gimbal through an RC Transmitter (aka \"RC Targeting\")"
msgstr ""
"有关通过RC遥控器控制云台所需参数更改的详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`此页面 <common-mount-targeting>` "
"的「使用RC遥控器控制」章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:57
#: b08e186009964fad86fc4fd921350fef
msgid "Configuring the Gimbal"
msgstr "配置云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:59
#: 4ddb84ded95c494eb7c6161fabe386a4
msgid "Connect the gimbal to your PC and using its configuration application"
msgstr "将云台连接至电脑并使用其配置应用程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:61
#: f876e8b3baf84533bf2ce0a6198a0cef
msgid ""
"if using SBUS input set the input channels to match the output channels from"
" the autopilot"
msgstr "若使用SBUS输入，将输入通道设置为与飞控输出通道匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:63
#: 2311150864994e6296b520fbaadc0917
msgid "set roll angle input to input to channel 9"
msgstr "将横滚角度输入设置为通道9。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:64
#: 4a9a8d54f72f4740a732a7189c9164c7
msgid "set pitch angle input to input to channel 10"
msgstr "将俯仰角度输入设置为通道10。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:65
#: 25a152860735404382b659f2d4823dce
msgid "set yaw angle input to input to channel 11"
msgstr "将偏航角度输入设置为通道11。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:67
#: 772dce9472614863b230486f17e5ffcc
msgid ""
"If the gimbal supports \"lock\" and \"follow\" yaw control it should be "
"configured for \"follow\"."
msgstr "若云台支持偏航的「锁定」和「跟随」控制，应配置为「跟随」模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:70
#: 1e778e4c5ec8411a9ed2e90235738a32
msgid "Control and Testing"
msgstr "控制与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:72
#: 86bad745019e4cf08f810a29051b3123
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>` for details on "
"how to control the gimbal using RC, GCS or Auto mode mission commands"
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>`，了解如何通过 RC、GCS 或 "
"Auto 模式任务命令控制云台的详细信息"
